    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Teams Event Companion",
    "summary": "The player scoring more VP wins. Matching scores produce a draw. Each **VP SOURCE** has its own **MAXIMUM VP**. The **PRIMARY MISSION** can give **45VP** overall, with a cap of **15VP** for a round. **SECONDARY MISSIONS** can give **45VP** overall and at most **15VP** in a round. An army meeting the **BATTLE READY ARMY** standard earns **10VP**. A Fixed Secondary Mission card can contribute up to **20VP** to its category.",
